exports[`novaclaw CLI help-text snapshots every documented command emits stable help text: novaclaw import --help 1`] = `
"⠀                                ▄     
█▀▀█ █▀▀█ █▀▀█ █▀▀▄ █▀▀▀ █▀▀█ █▀▀█ █▀▀█
█  █ █  █ █▀▀▀ █  █ █    █  █ █  █ █▀▀▀
▀▀▀▀ █▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀  ▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀

Commands:
  novaclaw completion          generate shell completion script
  novaclaw mcp                 manage MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers
  novaclaw [project]           start novaclaw tui                                          [default]
  novaclaw attach <url>        attach to a running novaclaw server
  novaclaw run [message..]     run novaclaw with a message
  novaclaw debug               debugging and troubleshooting tools
  novaclaw providers           manage AI providers and credentials                   [aliases: auth]
  novaclaw agent               manage agents
  novaclaw upgrade [target]    upgrade novaclaw to the latest or a specific version
  novaclaw uninstall           uninstall novaclaw and remove all related files
  novaclaw serve               starts a headless novaclaw server
  novaclaw web                 start novaclaw server and open web interface
  novaclaw models [provider]   list all available models
  novaclaw stats               show token usage and cost statistics
  novaclaw export [sessionID]  export session data as JSON
  novaclaw pr <number>         fetch and checkout a GitHub PR branch, then run novaclaw
  novaclaw session             manage sessions
  novaclaw plugin <module>     install plugin and update config                      [aliases: plug]
  novaclaw db                  database tools

Positionals:
  project  path to start novaclaw in                                                        [string]

Options:
  -h, --help          show help                                                            [boolean]
  -v, --version       show version number                                                  [boolean]
      --print-logs    print logs to stderr                                                 [boolean]
      --log-level     log level                 [string] [choices: "DEBUG", "INFO", "WARN", "ERROR"]
      --pure          run without external plugins                                         [boolean]
      --port          port to listen on                                        [number] [default: 0]
      --hostname      hostname to listen on                          [string] [default: "127.0.0.1"]
      --mdns          enable mDNS service discovery (defaults hostname to 0.0.0.0)
                                                                          [boolean] [default: false]
      --mdns-domain   custom domain name for mDNS service (default: novaclaw.local)
                                                                [string] [default: "novaclaw.local"]
      --cors          additional domains to allow for CORS                     [array] [default: []]
  -m, --model         model to use in the format of provider/model                          [string]
  -c, --continue      continue the last session                                            [boolean]
  -s, --session       session id to continue                                                [string]
      --fork          fork the session when continuing (use with --continue or --session)  [boolean]
      --prompt        prompt to use                                                         [string]
      --agent         agent to use                                                          [string]
      --mini          start the minimal interactive interface             [boolean] [default: false]
      --no-replay     disable mini session history replay on resume and after resize       [boolean]
      --replay-limit  cap visible mini replay to the newest N messages                      [number]
"
`;

